<ServiceHero
  section="services"
  slug="refrigerator-repair/samsung-error-codes"
  eyebrow="Samsung Refrigerator Error Codes · Reference Guide · Same Day Southern California"
  title="Samsung Refrigerator Error Codes, Explained"
  subtitle="What OF OF, 22E, 5E, and 88 88 actually mean — which you can clear yourself, which need a tech, and why OF OF isn't a breakdown at all."
